guide forever-dungeon-quests/shapers-terrace-horde
title The Shaper's Terrace (Horde)
category Dungeons
folder The Shaper's Terrace
faction Horde
levels 60-60
zone Undercity
keywords Shaper's Terrace, Un'Goro Crater, Master Apothecary Faranell, Chemist Fuely, Mayena Earthseeker, Undercity, Mulgore, Achromatic Crystal, crystal, Seeping Slime, Titanosaur, Venomridge, Nanaya, dungeon
why Every Horde quest of the Shaper's Terrace in one run.

# The Shaper's Terrace's Horde quests in one guide: the pick-ups in the
# Undercity and Mulgore, one run through the dungeon, then the hand-ins.
#
# The quests: Master Apothecary Faranell's 95926 The Dark Crystal (a Drained
# Crystal Fragment from the Achromatic Crystal, object 648579), Chemist
# Fuely's 97049 Essence of Seeping Slimes (eight, from the Seeping Slimes)
# and Mayena Earthseeker's 95928 Crystalline Elements (a Fiery, Charged,
# Noxious and Moist Crystal, each from its own crystal fragment object:
# 649099, 649097, 649100, 649103).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Horde's.
#
# Inside: no source names the door: Polestar's entrances, its players'
# recordings and the client's tables have none (checked 2026-11-21). So the
# guide names the dungeon without a point, and the goals inside carry none.
# No Horde quest is tied to a boss; the client's dungeon journal lists eleven
# (the Titanosaur first, Nanaya last). Every quest goal is counted by the
# quest log, so the order inside does not matter.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, level
#   60).
# - Lint warns that the inside goals have no coordinates: no source places
#   the door, and the data places nothing inside. They stay without, rather
#   than at a guessed point.
# INGAME: where is the Shaper's Terrace's door, and where inside do the
#   crystals and the Achromatic Crystal stand?

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  tip In the Undercity.
  accept 95926

step Chemist Fuely
  accept 97049

step Mayena Earthseeker
  zone Mulgore
  accept 95928

step To the Shaper's Terrace
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 60, in Un'Goro Crater.
  enter "The Shaper's Terrace"

step Crystals and slimes
  along until leave
  collect 271771 quest 95926.1 group 5 -- From the Achromatic Crystal.
  collect 271894 quest 95928.1 group 5 -- Each crystal comes from its own crystal fragment.
  collect 271898 quest 95928.2 group 5
  collect 271902 quest 95928.3 group 5
  collect 271912 quest 95928.4 group 5
  collect 276235 x8 quest 97049.1 group 5 -- The Seeping Slimes drop it.

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short of the crystals, the fragment and the slime essence, finish it before you go.
  collect 271771 quest 95926.1 group 5
  collect 271894 quest 95928.1 group 5
  collect 271898 quest 95928.2 group 5
  collect 271902 quest 95928.3 group 5
  collect 271912 quest 95928.4 group 5
  collect 276235 x8 quest 97049.1 group 5

step Mayena Earthseeker
  zone Mulgore
  turnin 95928

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  turnin 95926

step Chemist Fuely
  turnin 97049
